#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:495
msgid "Spinbuttons."
msgstr "Stegningsrutor."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:497
msgid ""
"Spinbuttons, like sliders, are widgets that allow a user to change the "
"numeric value in the cell by interacting with a widget. The value of "
"spinbuttons can be changed either by typing a new number into the text box "
"or by clicking on the arrow buttons. If the buttons are clicked and held, "
"the numeric value will spin, incrementing or decrementing depending on the "
"arrow being held."
msgstr ""
"Stegningsrutor fungerar ungefär som skjutreglage: de låter dig ändra en "
"cells talvärde med en gränssnittskomponent. Du kan ändra värdet genom att "
"skriva ett nytt tal i textrutan eller klicka på pilknapparna. Om du håller "
"en knapp nedtryckt ökar eller minskar värdet kontinuerligt, beroende på "
"vilken pil du håller ned."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:508
msgid "A spinbutton widget."
msgstr "En stegningsruta."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:512
